<title>ITALY: Italy share derivatives trade suspended in Milan.</title>
<headline>Italy share derivatives trade suspended in Milan.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in derivatives of Italian shares was suspended in Milan due to technical problems, the stock market council said.</p>
<p>Authorities said they would advise the market shortly when trading was set to restart.</p>
</text>
